<section class="pov">
  <div class="pov-inner">
    <span class="label scroll-reveal">/Our Belief</span>
    <div class="pov-stage">
      <p class="pov-text scroll-reveal">We believe a fearless brand is built on three things. <span class="kw" data-panel="p-purpose">Purpose</span> worth standing for. <span class="kw" data-panel="p-story">Story</span> that carries it. <span class="kw" data-panel="p-direction">Direction</span> that makes it real.</p>
      <div class="pov-panel" id="p-purpose">
        <span class="pov-panel-word">Purpose</span>
        <p class="pov-panel-desc">Why the brand exists and what it stands for. It gives every decision a reason, and makes people care.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pov-panel" id="p-story">
        <span class="pov-panel-word">Story</span>
        <p class="pov-panel-desc">What makes the brand make sense. It connects the parts into something people remember and want to belong to.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pov-panel" id="p-direction">
        <span class="pov-panel-word">Direction</span>
        <p class="pov-panel-desc">Where the brand is going and how it gets there. It turns belief into clear, confident action.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="pov-tail scroll-reveal">Get those right, and everything else follows. Most brands have at least one of the three. The fearless ones have all three working together, pulling in the same direction. That alignment is what we build, where strategy, creativity and innovation come together as one idea.</p>
